WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.635 --> 00:00:04.170
-President Trump wanted to dig
a trench on the Southern border

00:00:04.170 --> 00:00:05.805
and fill it with alligators
and snakes,

00:00:05.805 --> 00:00:07.106
and then, he lost his mind

00:00:07.106 --> 00:00:09.442
in a series of press conferences
about impeachment.

00:00:09.442 --> 00:00:11.778
For more on this,
it's time for "A Closer Look."

00:00:11.778 --> 00:00:13.312
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:13.312 --> 00:00:16.916 line:0%
♪♪

00:00:16.916 --> 00:00:18.818
I don't think it would surprise
you if I said

00:00:18.818 --> 00:00:20.886
that some very weird stuff
has been going on

00:00:20.886 --> 00:00:21.854
the past few weeks.

00:00:21.854 --> 00:00:23.022
I mean, weird stuff's

00:00:23.022 --> 00:00:24.557
been going on for four years,

00:00:24.557 --> 00:00:27.160
ever since a famously stupid
game show host

00:00:27.160 --> 00:00:29.562
came down the escalator
and forced his way

00:00:29.562 --> 00:00:32.064
into our hearts like
a stubborn piece of bacon fat.

00:00:32.064 --> 00:00:35.568
But the last two weeks
in particular have felt like

00:00:35.568 --> 00:00:38.871
that scene from "Ghostbusters"
where the EPA guy opens up

00:00:38.871 --> 00:00:40.706
the containment system
and ghosts just start

00:00:40.706 --> 00:00:42.442
pouring out into the city.

00:00:42.442 --> 00:00:44.810
In fact, I'm pretty sure
I saw the zombie cab driver

00:00:44.810 --> 00:00:47.046
on TV defending the president
the other day.

00:00:47.046 --> 00:00:49.214
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:49.214 --> 00:00:52.151
Even putting aside...

00:00:52.151 --> 00:00:54.520
even putting aside all
the recent revelations

00:00:54.520 --> 00:00:56.722
about Trump colluding
with foreign governments,

00:00:56.722 --> 00:00:59.291
we keep learning new details
about just how corrupt,

00:00:59.291 --> 00:01:01.027
lawless, and out of his mind
he is.

00:01:01.027 --> 00:01:03.929
For example, a new book reports
that Trump wanted to inflict

00:01:03.929 --> 00:01:06.766
horrific violence on desperate
migrants seeking asylum,

00:01:06.766 --> 00:01:08.134
offered pardons to officials

00:01:08.134 --> 00:01:09.935
who broke the law
to build his border wall,

00:01:09.935 --> 00:01:14.340
and had some truly insane ideas
for how to fortify that wall.

00:01:14.340 --> 00:01:16.375
-"The New York Times"
is reporting new details

00:01:16.375 --> 00:01:19.712
about ideas President Trump has
for the Southern border.

00:01:19.712 --> 00:01:22.281
Privately, the president
had often talked about

00:01:22.281 --> 00:01:26.352
fortifying a border wall
with a water-filled trench

00:01:26.352 --> 00:01:29.155
stocked with snakes
or alligators,

00:01:29.155 --> 00:01:32.025
prompting aides to seek
a cost estimate.

00:01:32.025 --> 00:01:34.227
-That's right. The president
of the United States

00:01:34.227 --> 00:01:36.096
wanted to dig
a water-filled trench

00:01:36.096 --> 00:01:37.730
and stock it with snakes
and alligators,

00:01:37.730 --> 00:01:39.832
you know, like some sort
of inbred medieval king.

00:01:39.832 --> 00:01:42.468
At night, he probably drinks
milkshakes from a goblet

00:01:42.468 --> 00:01:45.104
while Eric and Don Jr.
joust with golf clubs.

00:01:45.104 --> 00:01:46.439
[ Laughter ]

00:01:46.439 --> 00:01:48.474
I mean, seriously, think about
how insane this is.

00:01:48.474 --> 00:01:50.343
His aides actually had to go out

00:01:50.343 --> 00:01:53.045
and get a cost estimate
for this plan.

00:01:53.045 --> 00:01:54.446
How do you even do that?

00:01:54.446 --> 00:01:56.749
Walk over to the reptile section
at PetSmart

00:01:56.749 --> 00:01:59.151
with a map of the border
and be like,

00:01:59.151 --> 00:02:00.452
"I don't know, uh..."

00:02:00.452 --> 00:02:02.387
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:02.387 --> 00:02:03.889
Snake's like a foot long.

00:02:03.889 --> 00:02:06.326
The border's 2,000 miles.

00:02:06.326 --> 00:02:08.328
Can I get a billion snakes?

00:02:08.328 --> 00:02:09.896
[ Laughter ]

00:02:09.896 --> 00:02:11.730
No, I don't want you to worry

00:02:11.730 --> 00:02:13.900
that this snake-filled moat
thing is occupying

00:02:13.900 --> 00:02:15.368
too much of the president's time

00:02:15.368 --> 00:02:17.170
because he has moved on
to other topics.

00:02:17.170 --> 00:02:20.372
For example, President Caligula
over here is also arguing

00:02:20.372 --> 00:02:22.441
that impeaching him would
cause a civil war,

00:02:22.441 --> 00:02:23.776
accusing Democrats of treason,

00:02:23.776 --> 00:02:25.978
claiming the Ukraine
whistle-blower spied on him,

00:02:25.978 --> 00:02:27.179
and calling impeachment,

00:02:27.179 --> 00:02:28.581
which is a procedure laid out

00:02:28.581 --> 00:02:31.317
by the framers in
the Constitution, a coup.

00:02:31.317 --> 00:02:33.419
-President Trump ramping up
his attacks

00:02:33.419 --> 00:02:36.288
on the impeachment inquiry
engulfing his presidency.

00:02:36.288 --> 00:02:39.358
Tweeting overnight, "As I learn
more and more each day,

00:02:39.358 --> 00:02:41.961
I am coming to the conclusion
that what is taking place

00:02:41.961 --> 00:02:44.296
is not an impeachment.
It is a coup."

00:02:44.296 --> 00:02:45.865
-All right, first of all,
the way you know

00:02:45.865 --> 00:02:47.867
that tweet is wrong
is because it starts with

00:02:47.867 --> 00:02:49.435
"As I learn more each day."

00:02:49.435 --> 00:02:50.870
[ Laughter ]

00:02:50.870 --> 00:02:52.805
Trump forgets stuff every day.

00:02:52.805 --> 00:02:55.975
Today, he forgot there was
an "A" in "moat."

00:02:55.975 --> 00:02:57.710
Second, it's not a coup.

00:02:57.710 --> 00:03:00.012
It's a process laid out
in the Constitution

00:03:00.012 --> 00:03:01.180
by the founding fathers.

00:03:01.180 --> 00:03:03.315
It's not like if you
were removed from office,

00:03:03.315 --> 00:03:04.450
Democrats would take over

00:03:04.450 --> 00:03:06.152
and the military would
storm Trump tower

00:03:06.152 --> 00:03:07.787
and rename it the Hillary Hilton
or something.

00:03:07.787 --> 00:03:10.056
I mean, the worst thing
that would happen

00:03:10.056 --> 00:03:12.058
would be that Mike pence
would become president.

00:03:12.058 --> 00:03:13.759
And I assure you,
Democrats do not want

00:03:13.759 --> 00:03:14.960
a president Mike Pence either.

00:03:14.960 --> 00:03:16.295
For one thing,

00:03:16.295 --> 00:03:18.564
taxpayers would have to spend
millions every year

00:03:18.564 --> 00:03:19.966
replacing his batteries.

00:03:19.966 --> 00:03:21.567
[ Laughter ]

00:03:21.567 --> 00:03:24.070
Now, I know you're all worried
about one thing.

00:03:24.070 --> 00:03:26.539
It's the big question hanging
over all of this.

00:03:26.539 --> 00:03:29.509
And that is how is the president
handling all this emotionally?

00:03:29.509 --> 00:03:31.510
What's his state of mind?
How's he holding up?

00:03:31.510 --> 00:03:33.279
And the good news is
that judging from

00:03:33.279 --> 00:03:34.780
this very sane news conference

00:03:34.780 --> 00:03:36.482
he gave in the oval office
this afternoon

00:03:36.482 --> 00:03:38.751
with the president of Finland
sitting next to him,

00:03:38.751 --> 00:03:40.720
I'd say Trump seems to be
handling it all pretty well.

00:03:40.720 --> 00:03:43.889
-Adam Schiff, he's a lowlife.
He should be forced to resign.

00:03:43.889 --> 00:03:45.324
The call was perfect.

00:03:45.324 --> 00:03:46.659
In fact, Lindsey Graham said,

00:03:46.659 --> 00:03:48.394
"I didn't know you could be
so nice."

00:03:48.394 --> 00:03:51.263
There's needles and drugs all
over the street.

00:03:51.263 --> 00:03:54.467
He says, "Hey, hey,
tell Vlad I'll talk to him

00:03:54.467 --> 00:03:56.335
after the election's over.
I'll talk to him."

00:03:56.335 --> 00:03:58.303
She went crazy.

00:03:58.303 --> 00:04:00.940
She said "We can't impeach him
of this conversation.

00:04:00.940 --> 00:04:02.341
That's a great conversation."

00:04:02.341 --> 00:04:05.677
President Trump started
screaming, ranting, and raving.

00:04:05.677 --> 00:04:07.980
Alligators and snakes.

00:04:07.980 --> 00:04:09.648
Skin-piercing spikes.

00:04:09.648 --> 00:04:11.984
I said, "Why are you asking
that stupid question?"

00:04:11.984 --> 00:04:14.286
Everything "The Washington Post"
does is fake.

00:04:14.286 --> 00:04:15.888
It's a fake newspaper.

00:04:15.888 --> 00:04:17.590
I don't even use fake anymore.

00:04:17.590 --> 00:04:19.958
I call the fake news now
corrupt news.

00:04:19.958 --> 00:04:23.395
What happened in 2016
is a disgrace to this country.

00:04:23.395 --> 00:04:25.097
-Well, that I agree with.

00:04:25.097 --> 00:04:27.333
I mean, some crazy guy...

00:04:27.333 --> 00:04:31.404
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:31.404 --> 00:04:34.140
Some crazy guy lost
the popular vote

00:04:34.140 --> 00:04:36.341
and fell ass-backwards into
the presidency,

00:04:36.341 --> 00:04:39.244
and now the news has to run
chirons with the words,

00:04:39.244 --> 00:04:42.114
and this is real, "Trump denies
wanting snakes, gators,

00:04:42.114 --> 00:04:43.816
spikes on border."
[ Laughter ]

00:04:43.816 --> 00:04:46.685
I cannot express to you enough
just how deeply off the rails

00:04:46.685 --> 00:04:48.554
Trump's performance was today.
I mean, just look at this.

00:04:48.554 --> 00:04:51.224
This is an actual photo taken

00:04:51.224 --> 00:04:52.592
of the president
of the United States

00:04:52.592 --> 00:04:54.626
during an official oval office
meeting this afternoon.

00:04:54.626 --> 00:04:57.196
Look at that.
He looks like a rabid groundhog

00:04:57.196 --> 00:04:59.265
who just popped out of his hole

00:04:59.265 --> 00:05:01.734
and predicted six more weeks
of word vomit.

00:05:01.734 --> 00:05:03.035
[ Laughter ]

00:05:03.035 --> 00:05:05.771
It looks like a Python
jutting out of the Amazon River.

00:05:05.771 --> 00:05:08.341
They should put him in a moat
on the Southern border.

00:05:08.341 --> 00:05:10.476
[ Laughter ]

00:05:10.476 --> 00:05:12.144
It's not safe to cross!

00:05:12.144 --> 00:05:15.782
It's not safe to cross.

00:05:15.782 --> 00:05:18.084
So let's try taking these
one at a time.

00:05:18.084 --> 00:05:20.386
Trump slammed intelligence
committee chairman Adam Schiff.

00:05:20.386 --> 00:05:22.388
Trump has already called
for Schiff to be arrested

00:05:22.388 --> 00:05:24.089
for treason, and today,
he attacked Schiff

00:05:24.089 --> 00:05:26.392
for criticizing
Secretary of State Mike Pompeo

00:05:26.392 --> 00:05:28.394
who was on the Ukraine call
himself

00:05:28.394 --> 00:05:29.762
and is now threatening
to obstruct

00:05:29.762 --> 00:05:31.097
the impeachment inquiry.

00:05:31.097 --> 00:05:35.301
-This guy was negative
on Mike Pompeo.

00:05:35.301 --> 00:05:37.003
He can't -- you know,
there's an expression.

00:05:37.003 --> 00:05:39.171
He couldn't carry
his blank strap.

00:05:39.171 --> 00:05:41.740
I won't say it because they'll
say it was so terrible to say.

00:05:41.740 --> 00:05:44.977
But that guy couldn't carry
his blank strap.

00:05:44.977 --> 00:05:47.179
-Of all the insane stuff
you've said,

00:05:47.179 --> 00:05:50.349
why would you think
the word jockstrap

00:05:50.349 --> 00:05:51.817
would suddenly be over the line?

00:05:51.817 --> 00:05:54.520
This morning, you called
the impeachment inquiry

00:05:54.520 --> 00:05:56.622
bull[bleep] on Twitter.

00:05:56.622 --> 00:05:59.558
But jockstrap
is beyond the pale?

00:05:59.558 --> 00:06:02.595
Or maybe -- maybe --
it's probably possible,

00:06:02.595 --> 00:06:05.130
he just couldn't remember
and he kept saying blank

00:06:05.130 --> 00:06:07.333
like he was a contestant
on "Password."

00:06:07.333 --> 00:06:10.336
-The password is...jock.

00:06:10.336 --> 00:06:13.139
-That guy couldn't carry
his blank strap.

00:06:13.139 --> 00:06:14.573
[ Laughter ]

00:06:14.573 --> 00:06:18.677
-Then, after that performance

00:06:18.677 --> 00:06:21.547
in the oval office,

00:06:21.547 --> 00:06:24.283
Trump moved locations
from one room to another

00:06:24.283 --> 00:06:27.052
where he held a press conference
with the president of Finland.

00:06:27.052 --> 00:06:29.388
And at one point, Trump
was asked about his repeated use

00:06:29.388 --> 00:06:31.958
of the word "treason"
to describe the whistle-blower

00:06:31.958 --> 00:06:33.692
and Democrats
who were investigating him.

00:06:33.692 --> 00:06:36.162
-Do you consider anyone
who opposes you treasonous?

00:06:36.162 --> 00:06:38.798
-No, no.
I consider when they lie.

00:06:38.798 --> 00:06:41.733
When they stand before
our great body

00:06:41.733 --> 00:06:45.637
in our great chamber
and they make up a story

00:06:45.637 --> 00:06:47.773
that's fiction like Schiff did.

00:06:47.773 --> 00:06:50.276
He took that perfect
conversation I had

00:06:50.276 --> 00:06:54.546
with the Ukrainian President,
and he made it into a total lie.

00:06:54.546 --> 00:06:58.250
Believe it or not, I watch
my words very carefully.

00:06:58.250 --> 00:07:00.553
-I don't believe it.
I don't believe it at all.

00:07:00.553 --> 00:07:03.355
You ramble like a guy
who just got handed a speedball

00:07:03.355 --> 00:07:05.191
in the bathroom at studio 54.

00:07:05.191 --> 00:07:06.759
[ As Trump ] [ Inhales sharply ]
Whoo! Come on, baby!

00:07:06.759 --> 00:07:08.194
Let's collude with
a foreign adversary

00:07:08.194 --> 00:07:10.830
and then dance our asses off
till sunrise, ha, ha, ha, ha!

00:07:10.830 --> 00:07:11.797
[ Laughter ]

00:07:11.797 --> 00:07:13.398
In fact, throughout today,

00:07:13.398 --> 00:07:15.534
Trump used the word "treason"
multiple times.

00:07:15.534 --> 00:07:17.403
And at one point,
he even said it

00:07:17.403 --> 00:07:19.605
as if he was quoting
someone else,

00:07:19.605 --> 00:07:22.975
a rhetorical tactic he used
not once, but twice.

00:07:22.975 --> 00:07:24.977
-Some people even say
it was treason.

00:07:24.977 --> 00:07:28.580
There are those that think
I'm a very stable genius.

00:07:28.580 --> 00:07:31.483
-Those people are you.

00:07:31.483 --> 00:07:33.018
You're quoting yourself.

00:07:33.018 --> 00:07:35.854
I'd say he's quoting
the voices in his head,

00:07:35.854 --> 00:07:37.990
but I'm pretty sure the only
things in his head are...

00:07:37.990 --> 00:07:40.860
-Alligators and snakes.
[ Laughter ]

00:07:40.860 --> 00:07:43.229
-Also, who would you be quoting?

00:07:43.229 --> 00:07:47.299
No one else has ever said the
words "stable genius" before.

00:07:47.299 --> 00:07:50.869
It's like "beautiful wall."
You're the only one who says it.

00:07:50.869 --> 00:07:52.905
And then, when a reporter
tried to ask Trump

00:07:52.905 --> 00:07:55.741
a very simple question --
what was he trying to accomplish

00:07:55.741 --> 00:07:57.643
on the call with
the Ukrainian president

00:07:57.643 --> 00:07:59.711
if he wasn't digging up dirt
on Joe Biden,

00:07:59.711 --> 00:08:01.180
Trump got very testy.

00:08:01.180 --> 00:08:03.248
-Ask a question please.
-Thank you, sir.

00:08:03.248 --> 00:08:04.983
-What about Mr. Biden?

00:08:04.983 --> 00:08:06.251
-What does he want about Biden?

00:08:06.251 --> 00:08:07.686
What did you want him
to look into on Biden?

00:08:07.686 --> 00:08:13.426
-Look, Biden and his son
are stone-cold crooked.

00:08:13.426 --> 00:08:14.727
And you know it.

00:08:14.727 --> 00:08:17.095
His son walks out with millions
of dollars.

00:08:17.095 --> 00:08:18.698
The kid knows nothing.

00:08:18.698 --> 00:08:21.433
You know it, and so do we.
Go ahead, ask a question.

00:08:21.433 --> 00:08:23.936
-The question, sir, was what did
you want President Zelensky

00:08:23.936 --> 00:08:28.507
to do about Vice President Biden
and his son Hunter?

00:08:28.507 --> 00:08:30.109
-Are you talking to me?
-Yeah.

00:08:30.109 --> 00:08:31.643
It was just a follow-up
of what I just asked you, sir.

00:08:31.643 --> 00:08:33.479
-Listen, listen. Are you ready?

00:08:33.479 --> 00:08:35.113
We have the president
of Finland.

00:08:35.113 --> 00:08:36.782
Ask him a question.
-I have one for him.

00:08:36.782 --> 00:08:38.917
I just wanted to follow up
on the one that I asked you.

00:08:38.917 --> 00:08:40.086
-Did you hear me?
-What did you want?

00:08:40.086 --> 00:08:41.153
-Did you hear me?
-Yes.

00:08:41.153 --> 00:08:42.855
-Ask him a question.
-I will. But --

00:08:42.855 --> 00:08:47.192
-I've given you a long answer.
Ask this gentleman a question.

00:08:47.192 --> 00:08:48.794
Don't be rude.

00:08:48.794 --> 00:08:51.830
-Don't drag him into this!
[ Laughter ]

00:08:51.830 --> 00:08:54.299
[ As Trump ] You should talk
to the president of Finland.

00:08:54.299 --> 00:08:57.536
He told me he wants to tell you
how innocent I am.

00:08:57.536 --> 00:09:01.140
In fact, he was on the call too.
It was all his idea."

00:09:01.140 --> 00:09:03.208
[ Normal voice ] He sounds like
a dad scolding his children

00:09:03.208 --> 00:09:04.610
to say hello to a houseguest.

00:09:04.610 --> 00:09:06.345
[ As Trump ] Don't be rude.
Say hello to Uncle Rudy.

00:09:06.345 --> 00:09:08.547
And this time,
don't kick him in the balls.

00:09:08.547 --> 00:09:10.182
[ Laughter ]

00:09:10.182 --> 00:09:11.917
[ Normal voice ] All of this of
course just adds to the portrait

00:09:11.917 --> 00:09:13.986
we already have of a lawless,
delusional president

00:09:13.986 --> 00:09:16.088
who thinks he can do whatever he
wants without consequences.

00:09:16.088 --> 00:09:17.856
Over the last two weeks,
for example,

00:09:17.856 --> 00:09:20.125
we found out that Trump
orchestrated a vast scheme

00:09:20.125 --> 00:09:22.361
in which he subverted
American foreign policy

00:09:22.361 --> 00:09:25.364
almost entirely to serve his
own personal political goals.

00:09:25.364 --> 00:09:28.033
He dangled a quid pro quo
to get the president of Ukraine

00:09:28.033 --> 00:09:29.234
to investigate Joe Biden.

00:09:29.234 --> 00:09:30.736
He told the Russians
in the oval office

00:09:30.736 --> 00:09:33.839
he didn't care that they
interfered in the 2016 election.

00:09:33.839 --> 00:09:36.442
And he asked the Prime Minister
of Australia to help him prove

00:09:36.442 --> 00:09:37.943
his insane conspiracy theories

00:09:37.943 --> 00:09:39.945
about the origins
of the Russia investigation.

00:09:39.945 --> 00:09:42.681
At this point, Trump is just
cold-calling countries

00:09:42.681 --> 00:09:44.483
asking them if they want to
collude.

00:09:44.483 --> 00:09:45.617
[ As Trump ] Hello, Ecuador?

00:09:45.617 --> 00:09:47.053
Do you have any dirt
on Joe Biden?

00:09:47.053 --> 00:09:48.253
[ Laughter ]

00:09:48.253 --> 00:09:51.724
No, you [muttering]

00:09:51.724 --> 00:09:53.492
Do you have Bolivia's number?

00:09:53.492 --> 00:09:56.061
[ Laughter ]

00:09:56.061 --> 00:09:57.796
Now, if you're wondering
why Trump was asking

00:09:57.796 --> 00:09:59.898
the Prime Minister of Australia
of all countries

00:09:59.898 --> 00:10:01.734
to help him dig up dirt
on the Mueller probe,

00:10:01.734 --> 00:10:03.736
the short version
is Australia found out Russia

00:10:03.736 --> 00:10:05.838
was trying to interfere
in U.S. elections

00:10:05.838 --> 00:10:07.239
and they tried to do
the right thing

00:10:07.239 --> 00:10:08.707
by reporting it to the FBI.

00:10:08.707 --> 00:10:11.376
And as we know, doing the right
thing is not Trump's style.

00:10:11.376 --> 00:10:13.312
-"The New York Times" reports
that Trump

00:10:13.312 --> 00:10:15.614
pushed the Australian
Prime Minister

00:10:15.614 --> 00:10:19.618
during another recent phone call
to help his Attorney General,

00:10:19.618 --> 00:10:23.055
Bill Barr, gather information
on the origins

00:10:23.055 --> 00:10:25.690
of the Mueller investigation
into him.

00:10:25.690 --> 00:10:27.025
Trump was, in effect,

00:10:27.025 --> 00:10:31.263
asking the Australian government
to investigate itself.

00:10:31.263 --> 00:10:34.332
FBI counterintelligence
investigators began examining

00:10:34.332 --> 00:10:38.437
any Trump ties to Russia's
2016 election interference

00:10:38.437 --> 00:10:41.240
after Australian officials
told the bureau

00:10:41.240 --> 00:10:43.042
that Russian intermediaries

00:10:43.042 --> 00:10:44.943
had made overtures
to Trump advisers

00:10:44.943 --> 00:10:47.812
about releasing
politically damaging information

00:10:47.812 --> 00:10:49.214
about Hillary Clinton.

00:10:49.214 --> 00:10:51.617
-That's right. Trump asked
the Australian Prime Minister

00:10:51.617 --> 00:10:53.118
to investigate his own
government

00:10:53.118 --> 00:10:56.421
for correctly reporting Russian
election meddling to the FBI.

00:10:56.421 --> 00:10:59.091
Or at least, whoever he thought
was the prime minister.

00:10:59.091 --> 00:11:00.592
[ Laughter ]

00:11:00.592 --> 00:11:03.128
[ As Trump ] Mr. Dundee,
thank you for meeting with me.

00:11:03.128 --> 00:11:05.030
Can I call you Crocodile?

00:11:05.030 --> 00:11:08.567
On that point, do you know
any other crocodiles

00:11:08.567 --> 00:11:11.337
who'd be willing to work
on the Southern border?

00:11:11.337 --> 00:11:12.704
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:11:12.704 --> 00:11:14.907
We have a beautiful moot.

00:11:14.907 --> 00:11:17.543
Beautiful moot for them
to swim in.

00:11:17.543 --> 00:11:19.110
[ Normal voice ] Now apparently,
Trump's overtures

00:11:19.110 --> 00:11:21.179
to all these countries are part
of an elaborate plot

00:11:21.179 --> 00:11:23.849
fueled by wild conspiracy
theories to do two things --

00:11:23.849 --> 00:11:25.918
manufacture a false smear
against Joe Biden

00:11:25.918 --> 00:11:28.287
and somehow prove that
the Russia investigation

00:11:28.287 --> 00:11:30.690
was a deep state hoax
created by the Democrats.

00:11:30.690 --> 00:11:33.058
And he used the levers
of government

00:11:33.058 --> 00:11:34.693
and U.S. diplomacy to do it.

00:11:34.693 --> 00:11:36.261
For example, he involved

00:11:36.261 --> 00:11:37.663
the Attorney General
William Barr

00:11:37.663 --> 00:11:39.465
by repeatedly invoking
his name on the call

00:11:39.465 --> 00:11:40.633
with the president of Ukraine.

00:11:40.633 --> 00:11:42.668
And then last week,
he mysteriously sent Barr

00:11:42.668 --> 00:11:45.137
on a trip to Italy
amid the Ukraine firestorm

00:11:45.137 --> 00:11:46.238
with no explanation.

00:11:46.238 --> 00:11:48.240
ABC reported that
Attorney General Barr

00:11:48.240 --> 00:11:50.575
has been on official travel
in Italy for the past few days.

00:11:50.575 --> 00:11:53.311
It's unclear why the trip
was only just revealed.

00:11:53.311 --> 00:11:55.547
Sorry, but since when
do government officials

00:11:55.547 --> 00:11:58.617
just get to go off to Italy
for secret unannounced trips

00:11:58.617 --> 00:11:59.719
without telling anyone?

00:11:59.719 --> 00:12:01.119
Normal people
don't get to do that.

00:12:01.119 --> 00:12:03.488
You never walked into your job
at Chipotle and been like,

00:12:03.488 --> 00:12:04.690
"Where's Brad?"

00:12:04.690 --> 00:12:07.426
"Oh, he decided to go
to Venice last night."

00:12:07.426 --> 00:12:08.761
"Don't worry,
it's a business trip.

00:12:08.761 --> 00:12:10.629
He's wrapping burritos
on a gondola."

00:12:10.629 --> 00:12:12.231
[ Laughter ]

00:12:12.231 --> 00:12:13.732
And then, yesterday,
we found out

00:12:13.732 --> 00:12:14.966
what that trip was all about.

00:12:14.966 --> 00:12:17.102
Trump also asked Italy
to help him dig up dirt

00:12:17.102 --> 00:12:18.270
on the Mueller investigation,

00:12:18.270 --> 00:12:21.106
and he sent Barr to Italy
as part of that mission.

00:12:21.106 --> 00:12:23.675
-Attorney General William Barr
traveled overseas to personally

00:12:23.675 --> 00:12:26.011
investigate the origins
of the Russia investigation

00:12:26.011 --> 00:12:28.013
into the 2016 Trump campaign.

00:12:28.013 --> 00:12:29.915
NBC News confirms Barr met with

00:12:29.915 --> 00:12:32.617
senior Italian intelligence
officials last week in Italy,

00:12:32.617 --> 00:12:34.819
and the president followed
through on a request from Barr

00:12:34.819 --> 00:12:37.523
to call Australia's Prime
Minister on his behalf.

00:12:37.523 --> 00:12:39.792
The investigation into
the origins of the Russia probe

00:12:39.792 --> 00:12:41.660
follows repeated
and unproven claims

00:12:41.660 --> 00:12:43.929
by the Trump administration
that President Trump

00:12:43.929 --> 00:12:45.230
was the target of a witch hunt.

00:12:45.230 --> 00:12:48.234
-Trump sent his Attorney General
to Italy to try to prove

00:12:48.234 --> 00:12:50.769
his insane conspiracy theory
that the Russia investigation

00:12:50.769 --> 00:12:53.371
was a deep state witch hunt
concocted by the Democrats.

00:12:53.371 --> 00:12:56.040
Trump watches so much TV now
he's just getting his ideas

00:12:56.040 --> 00:12:57.375
from "The Da Vinci Code."

00:12:57.375 --> 00:12:59.978
[ As Trump ] Go to the Vatican,
sneak into the basilica,

00:12:59.978 --> 00:13:02.381
and open the tomb
of Rudy Giuliani.

00:13:02.381 --> 00:13:03.481
[ Laughter ]

00:13:03.481 --> 00:13:06.352
And then shake him awake.

00:13:06.352 --> 00:13:08.621
Urgh!

00:13:08.621 --> 00:13:09.855
[ Normal voice ]
What's happening is simple --

00:13:09.855 --> 00:13:12.191
An unhinged President
disconnected from reality

00:13:12.191 --> 00:13:15.160
is using his power to pursue
insane conspiracy theories

00:13:15.160 --> 00:13:16.595
and dig up dirt on his
opponents,

00:13:16.595 --> 00:13:18.030
and he and his aides
are obstructing

00:13:18.030 --> 00:13:19.464
an official impeachment inquiry.

00:13:19.464 --> 00:13:22.000
Proving once again that his
administration is full of...

00:13:22.000 --> 00:13:24.402
-Alligators and snakes.

00:13:24.402 --> 00:13:25.571
-This has been "A Closer Look."

00:13:25.571 --> 00:13:27.172
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:13:27.172 --> 00:13:29.408 line:0%
♪♪

